  "title": "Banana Chocolate Chip Bread",
  "description": "This chocolate chip banana bread is sweet and moist thanks to the addition of very ripe bananas; lots of chocolate chips turn it into a special treat!",
  "authors": [
    "iggytakahashi"
  ],
