  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "3 ripe bananas, mashed",
    "1 tablespoon milk",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon, or to taste",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup butter, softened",
    "2 large eggs",
    "1 cup semisweet chocolate chips"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Pwf9IhhFGMyCIR0MLfcu7OVdkBM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/230482-banana-chocolate-chip-bread-ddmfs-ingredients-3x4-0472-83623f05025843b493916b3b2e9c69d9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230482/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Grease a 9x5-inch loaf pan, preferably glass.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix flour, baking powder, baking soda, and salt in a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ptEse6egT91gQYOCUJMXs1b9T08=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/230482-banana-chocolate-chip-bread-ddmfs-step-02-3x4-0474-a350f5acf71443dc85a71c4af68db0c7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230482/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir bananas, milk, and cinnamon in another bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4KZPaohZ6OnW14LgSafvc9o73Lc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/230482-banana-chocolate-chip-bread-ddmfs-step-03-3x4-0477-e67e558a54e44ac5905548d8330e4990.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230482/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat sugar and butter together in a third bowl with an electric mixer until light and fluffy; add eggs one at a time, beating well after each addition.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/msg9zzIPx6mWVPA-ZG3Yn00QF48=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/230482-banana-chocolate-chip-bread-ddmfs-step-04-3x4-0479-cae713a52a9b4b71a230cb54693b1078.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230482/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir banana mixture into butter mixture; mix in flour mixture until just blended. Fold in chocolate chips; pour batter into the prepared loaf pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iO8UCiHW4KwRWtSVdbXlKgzUDkE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/230482-banana-chocolate-chip-bread-ddmfs-step-06-3x4-0481-a368d33d877749cdbfe51229b225343a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230482/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, about 70 minutes. Cool in the pan for 10 minutes before removing to cool completely on a wire rack before slicing.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q0xSQXx4gVX8rWobXWvqJo_L1yo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/230482-banana-chocolate-chip-bread-ddmfs-step-07-3x4-0482-0d1aea98c8a04ce78cd6bc9008763e13.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230482/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jPNAVHnI0-Fy7jIUqrPDI5K1ORo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/230482-banana-chocolate-chip-bread-ddmfs-beauty-3x4-0504-57b8bdac318b4d84ba58eaccd3672eef.jpg"
